          "path": "_m/w/y/n/5/hiroshima-peace-memorial-museum-wp/it-s-a-long-walk-to-the-partly.jpg",
          "filename": "It's a long walk to the partly closed Peace Memorial Park museum (49495521706).jpg",
          "caption": "It's a long walk from the atom bomb dome (Genbaku Dome- see previous pictures earlier in this album) to the partly closed Peace Memorial Park museum in Hiroshima's Peace Memorial Park. The Hiroshima Peace Memorial Museum is the primary museum in the park dedicated to educating visitors about the USA's atom bomb. The Museum has exhibits and information covering the buildup to war, the role of Hiroshima in the war up to the bombing, and extensive information on the bombing and its effects, along with substantial memorabilia and pictures from the bombing. The building also has views of the Memorial Cenotaph, Peace Flame, and A-Bomb Dome all of you have already seen earlier in this album. (see previous pictures).  (Hiroshima,Japan, Apr/ May 2019)",
          "alt": "It's a long walk from the atom bomb dome (Genbaku Dome- see previous pictures earlier in this album) to the partly closed Peace Memorial Park museum in Hiroshima's Peace Memorial Park. The Hiroshima Peace Memorial Museum is the primary museum in the park dedicated to educating visitors about the USA's atom bomb. The Museum has exhibits and information covering the buildup to war, the role of Hiroshima in the war up to the bombing, and extensive information on the bombing and its effects, along with substantial memorabilia and pictures from the bombing. The building also has views of the Memorial Cenotaph, Peace Flame, and A-Bomb Dome all of you have already seen earlier in this album. (see previous pictures).  (Hiroshima,Japan, Apr/ May 2019)",
