        {
          "path": "_m/w/y/n/5/hiroshima-peace-memorial-museum-wp/for-chrissakes-in-what-way-did.jpg",
          "filename": "For Chrissakes, in what way did these small schoolkids harm America's interests? (49495021648).jpg",
          "caption": "Hiroshima totally annihilated by the USA's atom bomb in 1945- picture 11 of 13: Sign about a display of the remains of the belongings of three high school students who perished in the USA's brutal atom bomb attack over Hiroshima in Japan. For Chrissakes, in what way did these small school kids harm America's interests, I wonder? Granted that the Japanese were not angels during the war either, and committed several atrocities, especially in SE Asia, but to take revenge for that by flattening an entire city and wiping out much of it's local population- including innocent women and children really beats me. Detailed notes about the USA's atom bomb attack over Hiroshima and other details appeared earlier in this album. (see previous pictures) (Hiroshima,Japan, Apr/ May 2019)",
          "alt": "Hiroshima totally annihilated by the USA's atom bomb in 1945- picture 11 of 13: Sign about a display of the remains of the belongings of three high school students who perished in the USA's brutal atom bomb attack over Hiroshima in Japan. For Chrissakes, in what way did these small school kids harm America's interests, I wonder? Granted that the Japanese were not angels during the war either, and committed several atrocities, especially in SE Asia, but to take revenge for that by flattening an entire city and wiping out much of it's local population- including innocent women and children really beats me. Detailed notes about the USA's atom bomb attack over Hiroshima and other details appeared earlier in this album. (see previous pictures) (Hiroshima,Japan, Apr/ May 2019)",
